# OS
.DS_Store

# Terraform
**/.terraform/
**/.terragrunt-cache/
**/.terragrunt-stack/
*.tfstate
*.tfstate.*
crash*.log
override.tf
override.tf.json
*_override.tf
*_override.tf.json

# Terraform variable files may hold secret values; ignore by default.
*.tfvars
*.tfvars.json
!*.tfvars.example

# Helm
**/charts/*.tgz

# Secrets: only the personal lab's own per-value encrypted ciphertext files
# (one file per value, never combined - constitution §5/§14) and one-way
# bcrypt hashes under secrets/vk-lab-platform/, the account-global
# root-domain.enc, plus this directory's own docs, are tracked. Every other
# secrets/<project>/ directory - throwaway CI/test projects, make
# generate-secrets output - is fully untracked, *.enc included; it's meant
# to be regenerated, not committed.
secrets/*
!secrets/vk-lab-platform/
secrets/vk-lab-platform/*
!secrets/vk-lab-platform/*.enc
!secrets/vk-lab-platform/*.bcrypt
!secrets/root-domain.enc
!secrets/README.md

# Editors
.vscode/
.idea/

# Claude Code local state: permissions, worktrees, session data - all machine-specific
.claude/
